      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- Use the Rune keyboard on the left to construct and insert Tunic language characters into this document"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- Enter translation ideas into the Rune keyboard textboxes and see the doc update in realtime"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- Use standard editing techniques in this doc like selecting, copy, paste, delete, undo and redo! (arrow keys and shift works best for selecting Rune characters)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "type": "text", "text": "- Use the buttons up top to save and re-open your work" }
